      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Title Amount (RM) Parliament 86,650,000 Office of the Keeper of the Rulers’ Seal 2,248,000 Audit Department 169,087,000 Election Commission 83,032,000 Public Services Commission 54,140,000 Prime Minister’s Department 5,869,615,000 Public Service Department 2,181,617,000 Attorney General’s Chambers 197,384,000 Malaysian Anti-Corruption Commission 297,510,000 Treasury 3,266,545,000 Treasury General Services 34,574,370,000 Contribution to Statutory Funds 2,916,949,000 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 641,837,000 Ministry of Plantation Industries and 1,318,495,000 Commodities Ministry of Agriculture and Agro-based 4,367,380,000 Industry Ministry of Rural and Regional 5,724,380,000 Development Ministry of Natural Resources and 1,112,097,000 Environment Ministry of International Trade and 601,078,000 Industry Ministry of Domestic Trade, Co-operatives 1,131,420,000 and Consumerism Ministry of Works 2,605,544,000 Ministry of Transport 1,311,071,000 Ministry of Energy, Green Technology 135,748,000 and Water Ministry of Science, Technology and 734,791,000 Innovation Ministry of Tourism and Culture 1,219,591,000 Ministry of the Federal Territories 504,770,000 Education Service Commission 16,837,000 Ministry of Education 50,565,450,000 Purpose Title B. 42 Ministry of Health B. 43 Ministry of Urban Wellbeing, Housing and Local Government B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources B. 47 Ministry of Communication and Multimedia B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development B. 60 Ministry of Defence B. 62 Ministry of Home Affairs TOTAL"
